{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"We first examined the relationship between LFP spectral power and GI RPC scores in trials without FOG, in the DOPAOFF condition, in both patients with PD groups.\",\n    \"The analysis included data from 267 dipoles located within the STN (139 and 128 in the posterior and central STN, respectively), comprising 946 traces (725 in FOG-NOBS and 221 in FOG-OBS patients; see Figs 1D and 4).\",\n    \"To explore STN dysfunction linked to FOG, we compared trials with freezing (FOG-OBS+ trials) to those without (FOG-OBS− trials) in FOG-OBS patients with PD (DOPAOFF condition; Fig 6).\",\n    \"These changes were evident as early as the GI phase, prior to the observable FOG onset.\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"We recorded GI and STN local field potentials (LFPs) via externalized cables in 38 patients with PD (35 reporting FOG in daily life), both OFF- and ON-dopamine (DOPA).\",\n    \"DOPAOFF, 12 patients with PD had FOG observed (FOG-OBS, 263 episodes), occurring at a mean of 8 steps after GI, and 26 had no FOG observed (NOBS; FOG-NOBS).\",\n    \"In the 12 FOG-OBS patients with PD, we recorded 99 trials where a FOG event occurred in the DOPAOFF condition (FOG-OBS+ trials), with a median onset of 8 steps (interquartile range [IQR] = 6–11.5) after GI, and a total of 263 FOG episodes (Fig 1E–G).\",\n    \"These FOG-OBS patients also completed 212 walking trials without FOG (FOG-OBS− trials; see Fig 1E).\",\n    \"To explore STN dysfunction linked to FOG, we compared trials with freezing (FOG-OBS+ trials) to those without (FOG-OBS− trials) in FOG-OBS patients with PD (DOPAOFF condition; Fig 6).\",\n    \"These changes were evident as early as the GI phase, prior to the observable FOG onset.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的说法有部分依据。原文确实将大量无FOG试次作为主要分析对象，并报告了946条来自无FOG试次的LFP分析记录；而且神经活动分析发生在步态启动阶段，变化出现在可观察到FOG之前，因此没有直接测量冻结发作进行期间的神经活动。但是，报告遗漏了一个重要限定：研究还明确分析了99个随后实际发生FOG的步行试次，共263次冻结事件，并在Figure 6中比较了发生冻结与未发生冻结的试次。因此，研究不仅提供FOG易感性证据，也提供了与即将发生FOG相关的冻结前神经活动证据。指控者关于38名患者、12名观察到FOG、99个阳性试次和263次冻结事件，以及阳性试次中的神经信号属于冻结前活动的描述，均有全文依据。不过，报告使用了“主要分析”，并非声称所有分析试次都没有FOG；此外，原文的信号分析以步态启动为时间参照，而非与FOG起始时刻直接对齐。因此，指控者认为报告完全错误地描述了这些试次，以及将其称为严格意义上的FOG事件锁定神经活动，都需要限定。最准确的结论是：报告对研究证据的概括不够完整，但指控者指出的阳性试次分析确实存在；两者不能简单理解为完全互斥。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "52ae4e22-4132-49d8-beb8-951c7148bf86", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T125041868318Z", "elapsed_seconds": 211.016, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T12:54:12.892125+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b9aa9c631b78087bdf3d53add669d011b8916b699b18a00e8a977cf90d06e4c5", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T125041868318Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "f5d27e6fb7e0430a06194969c2b5529652dc3ee24bbaf6822d10148918be8a34"}}}
